      </section>
      <h2 id="machine-mgmt-intro-managing-compute_overview-of-machine-management" class="group scroll-mt-20">Compute machine management<a href="#machine-mgmt-intro-managing-compute_overview-of-machine-management" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p class="_abstract">As a cluster administrator, you can manage the compute machines in your OpenShift Container Platform cluster.</p>
