      </li>
      <li>Create a machine set for a bare metal deployment: <a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/machine_management/creating_machinesets/creating-machineset-bare-metal#creating-machineset-bare-metal">Creating a compute machine set on bare metal</a></li>
      <li><a href="/openshift-docs-markdown/machine_management/manually-scaling-machineset#manually-scaling-machineset">Manually scale a compute machine set</a> by adding or removing a machine from the compute machine set.</li>
